# Articles API

A small example exercising every Blueprint+ Tier-A feature.

# Group Articles

CRUD over the article corpus.

+ Meta
    + Kind: nav
    + Owner-Team: editorial

## Article Collection [/articles{?q,limit}]

+ Parameters
    + q: news (string, optional) - Free-text query.
    + limit: 20 (number, optional) - Page size (defaults to 20).

### List Articles [GET]

+ Meta
    + OperationId: listArticles
    + Tags: Articles, Public
    + Idempotent: true

+ Parameters
    + traceId: abc123 (string, optional) - `[header:X-Trace-Id]` Trace id.
    + sessionId (string, optional) - `[cookie]` Session.

+ Request Minimal (application/json)
    + Body

            {}

+ Request With Filters (application/json)
    + Body

            { "q": "news", "limit": 10 }

+ Response 200 (application/json)
    Page of articles.

    + Attributes (array[Article])

## Article [/articles/{id}]

+ Parameters
    + id (string, required) - Article UUID.

### Retrieve Article [GET]

+ Meta
    + OperationId: getArticle
    + Docs: https://docs.example.com/getArticle - Detailed guide

+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Attributes (Article)

+ Response 404 (application/json)
    + Attributes (Error)

### Replace Article [PUT]

+ Meta
    + OperationId: replaceArticle
    + Deprecated: true
    + Tags: +Beta

+ Request (application/json)
    + Attributes (Article)

+ Response 204

# Group Article Events

Server-pushed notifications when an article changes.

## Article Created [/article.created]

### Article Created [POST]

+ Meta
    + OperationId: onArticleCreated
    + Security:

+ Request (application/json)
    + Attributes (Article)

+ Response 200

# Data Structures

## SecuritySchemes (object)
+ BearerAuth (object)
    + type: http
    + scheme: bearer
    + bearerFormat: JWT
    + description: `Short-lived JWT issued by /login.`

+ ApiKeyAuth (object)
    + type: apiKey
    + in: header
    + name: `X-API-Key`

+ OAuth2 (object)
    + type: oauth2
    + flows (object)
        + authorizationCode (object)
            + authorizationUrl: https://auth.example.com/authorize
            + tokenUrl: https://auth.example.com/token
            + scopes (object)
                + read: Read access.
                + write: Write access.

## Article (object)
+ id: `8c6e8f54-dc08-4e62-9a20-5e0c9e1c1234` (string, required) - Article UUID.
+ title: Hello (string, required)
+ subtitle (string, nullable)
+ published_at: `2024-01-15T10:00:00Z` (string, required)
+ status: draft (enum[string], required)
    + draft - Authoring in progress.
    + published - Live on the site.
    + archived - Removed from indexes.
+ author_email: editor@example.com (string)

## Error (object)
+ code: not_found (string, required)
+ message: Article not found (string, required)

